OL,3,CFootballer jailed after filming
OL,4,Chimself driving at nearly 200mph
OL,6,FA semi-pro footballer who was filmed
OL,7,Fdriving at 191mph has been jailed and
OL,8,Fbanned from driving.
OL,10,F32-year-old Connor Charlton reached
OL,11,Fspeeds of 191mph on West Yorkshire
OL,12,Froads.
OL,14,FThe Crown Prosecution Service showed
OL,15,FCharlton drifting his BMW at a
OL,16,Froundabout, with tyres screeching and
OL,17,Falmost causing a collision with a van.
OL,19,FIn another clip, a passenger filmed
OL,20,Fhim driving at 191mph on a motorway in
OL,21,Fthe West Yorkshire area.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/2
