PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786565892
OL,3,CFootballer jailed after filming
OL,4,Chimself driving at nearly 200mph
OL,6,FThe centre forward, who plays for
OL,7,FNostell Miners Welfare in the Northern
OL,8,FCounties East League, was also
OL,9,Finvolved in a scam where other drivers
OL,10,Ftook penalty points for speeding
OL,11,Foffences in return for cash.
OL,13,FThe CPS said Charlton, from Hunslet,
OL,14,FLeeds, admitted 10 counts of dangerous
OL,15,Fdriving and four offences of
OL,16,Fperverting the course of justice.
OL,18,FHe was jailed at Leeds Crown Court for
OL,19,Ffour years and banned from driving for
OL,20,Ffour years and seven months.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/2
